Third-party components
----------------------
Components incorporated as submodules or vendored dependencies retain their
own licences, which are not superseded by this file. In particular:

  - CVA6 (OpenHW Group)      — Solderpad Hardware License 2.0
  - Ibex (lowRISC)           — Apache License 2.0
  - X-HEEP                   — Solderpad Hardware License 2.1

Verify the licence of each component at the pinned revision before
redistribution. Where a component's licence conflicts with the terms above,
the component's own licence governs that component.

PDK and foundry data
--------------------
No process design kit data, foundry-provided library data, or data derived from
either is covered by this licence, and none may be committed to this repository.
See docs/07-implementation-constraints.md, requirements R-7.6 through R-7.9.

