Note for maintainers
--------------------
Before making this repository public, add the verbatim licence texts as
LICENSE-APACHE and LICENSE-SOLDERPAD alongside this file. Several distribution
channels and licence scanners require the full text to be present in the
repository rather than referenced by URL.
